bration is not getting completed within  the dwell time i.e when -45/-48/-50 dBm is seen as NF value,   firmware will replace those by 0 and return to host.  CL#1409141  Issue : ACS noise floor on channel 1 is 10 to 20dB lower than   on channels 2-11 Change Description: If ChannelSwitch happens from 5G to 2G and dual-band  radio, then do force reset so that NF value will be proper in channel 1   --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------          BUG=chrome-os-partner:37285 TEST=boot whirlwind and check if ath10k driver      loads firmware 10.2.4.70.12-2.  Change-Id: I092556c14341e711b2700fef31b53543c057b771 Signed-off-by: Srinivasa duvvuri &lt;sduvvuri@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/312556 Commit-Ready: Yixiang Li &lt;yixiang@google.com&gt; Tested-by: Yixiang Li &lt;yixiang@google.com&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="312556" owner_email="yixiang@google.com" pass_count="0" patch_number="2" project="chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" ref="refs/changes/56/312556/2" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I593c449e0194f3f72f4bcf712a03be472e12076d" commit="5171d5db417d4990687a5779df31c8672f125c19" commit_message="brillo_update_payload: Pass postinstall config file to delta_generator.  If the target_files.zip contains META/postinstall_config.txt, then extract it and pass the path to delta_generator.  BUG=b:24537566 TEST=Called brillo_update_payload with a target_files.zip that contains postinstall_config.txt  Change-Id: I593c449e0194f3f72f4bcf712a03be472e12076d Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/312550 Commit-Ready: Sen Jiang &lt;senj@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Sen Jiang &lt;senj@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Sen Jiang &lt;senj@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="1" gerrit_number="312550" owner_email="senj@chrom